     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap CdaSTEDONToStringConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"en-CdaSTEDONToStringConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcCdaSTEDONToStringConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-ST.html\">ST: CharacterString (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\">string</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-ST.html#s-ST.xmlText\">ST.xmlText</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string#s-string\">string</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Le texte CDA ST (xmlText) alimente directement un string FHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-ED.html\">ED: EncapsulatedData (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\">string</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-ED.html#s-ED.xmlText\">ED.xmlText</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a